{"type":"text","id":"policy","x":520,"y":1160,"width":760,"height":110,"text":"4 种拒绝策略（RejectedExecutionHandler）：\n• AbortPolicy（默认）：直接抛出 RejectedExecutionException\n• CallerRunsPolicy：由提交任务的调用者线程亲自执行\n• DiscardPolicy：默默丢弃新任务，不抛异常\n• DiscardOldestPolicy：丢弃队列中最老任务，再重试提交","originalText":"4 种拒绝策略（RejectedExecutionHandler）：\n• AbortPolicy（默认）：直接抛出 RejectedExecutionException\n• CallerRunsPolicy：由提交任务的调用者线程亲自执行\n• DiscardPolicy：默默丢弃新任务，不抛异常\n• DiscardOldestPolicy：丢弃队列中最老任务，再重试提交","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":736,"version":1,"versionNonce":736,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5}
